msgid "Update schedule"
msgstr ""

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The pipeline runs automatically once a day, at a fixed time: %(t)s. If "
"the computer hosting it is off at that moment, that day's run is skipped "
"and the site keeps the previous data."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reading the data"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This site aggregates public reporting. Every claim carries the confidence"
" its source stated, and should be checked against the linked original "
"before being relied on. Coverage is only as good as the source list: "
"Chinese-language sources are currently under-represented, so the "
"\"against China\" direction is sparse."
msgstr ""

msgid "Content policy"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only titles, metadata and our own short summaries are published here. "
"Full article text is never republished; follow the source links for the "
"originals."
msgstr ""

